uthern","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"nB7LcJIvZr-EbJj4oFZf-A","review_id":"G1wCBo4x6UF7ZseF2lM0DQ","date":"2018-06-21T12:28:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9342308044433594,"text_excerpt":"I really like this place. It was suggested by one of the locals at my hotel and I'm glad they did. It's a homestyle cafe and the prices are pretty cheap for the area. I ordered the shrimp and grits and it's really good. I've pretty much made this place my regular breakfast spot while in town. They have a$2.99 special if you come in before 8am and they have BOGO bloody mary and mimosas. I've gotten the same server everytime I've come in, Kristy, and she's really cool. She takes care of you so you can get in and out. The shrimp and grits entree is just right and portions are good also. I know there are several locations in close proximity to one another, but this location seems to have it t..."},{"business_id":"nB7LcJIvZr-EbJj4oFZf-A","review_id":"TFTJW33qryzAJAfAPRwKBw","date":"2013-10-24T18:10:44","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9247874617576599,"text_excerpt":"I enjoyed my visit to this place. When I walked in, I was told I could sit anywhere I liked. I sat at the bar. The girl behind the bar helped me unTil my waitress came out and when she finally did come out, she was really sweet and eager to help. I got one of the everyday specials that gave you half of any poboy and a side (I believe the choices were limited to gumbo and something else, but I don't remember, sorry). I got the alligator poboy and gumbo. It was GREAT! My only issue is that the piece of sausage was so big and the poboy was so packed with lettuce and diced tomatoes, I could barely bite into it and it eventually fell apart in my hand. I had to ask for a knife and fork and eat ..."},{"business_id":"nB7LcJIvZr-EbJj4oFZf-A","review_id":"wz1PDn5L91aJ1V15QRyaPw","date":"2017-03-05T22:44:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9213665723800659,"text_excerpt":"Went for breakfast, a really short walk from my hotel. Breakfast was great, I had a Cajun omelette with fries and a biscuit. Hubby had pancakes. Everything was good even the coffee. Service was great, prompt and with a smile. While eating there were a lot of plates given to other customers, Wow it all looked good. Think I might go back for dinner. Okay, I went back for lunch and had the seafood platter. Fried Shrimps, fried oysters and catfish $19.99. Good deal!!! Taste good."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"nB7LcJIvZr-EbJj4oFZf-A","photo_id":"56Za2lRcGZpft_2QNKu16Q","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/56Za2lRcGZpft_2QNKu16Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9303842782974243},{"business_id":"nB7LcJIvZr-EbJj4oFZf-A","photo_id":"OddiZrX_1mTirJEjArul_w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/OddiZrX_1mTirJEjArul_w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8397231698036194},{"business_id":"nB7LcJIvZr-EbJj4oFZf-A","photo_id":"PC4CR1Wl3OopOxYTp6xBOw","label":"